{"kode":"CLPI","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"115","email":["herlina@colorpak.co.id"],"fax":"021  - 590-1963 ","npwp":"01.061.759.5-054.000","phone":"021-590-19-62","website":"www.colorpak.co.id","key":"","lastupdate":"2021-12-28T14:00:34+07:00","value":"<td colspan='4'>Jl. Cideng Barat No.15\r\nJakarta Pusat 10140\n\n        \t\t  \t\t\tPhone: 021-590-19-62\n        \t\t  \t\t\tFax: 021  - 590-1963 \n                            NPWP: 01.061.759.5-054.000\n        \t\t  \t\t\tEmail: herlina@colorpak.co.id\n        \t\t  \t\t\tWebsite: www.colorpak.co.id\n\n        \t  \t\t\t</td>","office":"Jl. Cideng Barat No.15 Jakarta Pusat 10140"}],"background":"Didirikan pada tahun 1988, PT Colorpak Indonesia Tbk. (CLPI), saat ini bergerak di bidang manufaktur tinta cetak, pelapis, perekat dan perdagangan perlengkapan cetak lainnya seperti BOP Film dan PET Film.\n\nPada tahun 2010, Colorpak hanya beroperasi dengan satu pabrik di Tangerang – Banten menempati area seluas 13.125 m2 dan memiliki kapasitas terpasang sebesar 10.000 MT.\n\nPada tahun 2011, Colorpak mempunyai pabrik yang kedua di Sidoarjo – Jawa Timur dengan menempati area seluas 12.009 m2 dengan kapasitas terpasang sebesar 2.500 MT per tahun.\n\nProduk-produk kami meliputi :\n\nManufaktur :\nTinta untuk Flexible packaging & Cigarette packaging\nEnviromental friendly ink\nPVC leather coating\n\nPerdagangan :\nFilm (BOPP, PET, NYLON, MPET, etc)\nAdhesive (Solvent base, Solvent less, etc).\nPlatic Resin\n\nPasar kami saat ini tersebar di DKI Jakarta, Banten, Jawa Barat, Jawa Tengah, Jawa Timur, Medan dan juga ekspor ke Australia dan China. Kami terus membidik pasar-pasar potensial lainnya di dalam negeri maupun di regional Asia Pasifik, sesuai visi perusahaan.\n\nPada tahun 2001, perseroan telah mencatatkan seluruh sahamnya pada Bursa Efek Jakarta dengan kode perdagangan CLPI, dengan demikian sebagai perusahaan publik, maka tuntutan yang ada akan menjadi semakin tinggi.\n\nUntuk itu kami selalu mengutamakan mutu dan layanan prima dan senantiasa mengembangkan diri dalam segala bidang untuk menyajikan yang terbaik dalam melayani para pelanggan.","history":{"amount":"10 B","board":"Papan Pengembangan","date":"30 Nov 2001","price":"200","registrar":"","shares":"50,000,000","underwriters":["PT. Sucorinvest Central Gani"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Sinartama Gunita","free_float":"17.65%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[{"id":"33239352","key":"Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-06-19T13:29:34+07:00","value":"TJIA HWIE TJIN"}],"director":[{"id":"33239351","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-19T13:29:34+07:00","value":"HERLINA HATORANGAN"},{"id":"33239350","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-19T13:29:34+07:00","value":"ANTONI GUNAWAN"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"33239354","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2026-06-19T13:29:34+07:00","value":"DIDIK SUSILO"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"33239353","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-06-19T13:29:34+07:00","value":"HARRIS PRANATAJAYA"}],"president_director":[{"id":"33239349","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-19T13:29:34+07:00","value":"SANTOSO JIEMY"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[{"id":"12529083","key":"","lastupdate":"2021-12-28T14:00:34+07:00","value":"{\"name\":\"Ibu Herlina Hatorangan\",\"phone\":\"021-590-19-62\",\"email\":\"herlina@colorpak.co.id\"}"}],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"50.9991%","name":"INK COLOR INT PTE LTD","value":"156.23 M","badges":["pengendali"],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"28.255%","name":"MASYARAKAT NON WARKAT","value":"86.53 M","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"perc